WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:05.689
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: Dr. Bright!

00:00:05.689 --> 00:00:08.460
SCP-682 is NOT a Wondertainment Product!

00:00:08.460 --> 00:00:13.150
Dr. Wondertainment has produced plenty of
strange and unusual products over the years,

00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:17.510
from Custom Pets to household robots, to the
mysterious Little Misters.

00:00:17.510 --> 00:00:23.109
But one thing the anomalous toy company has
never made is a giant hateful reptile that

00:00:23.109 --> 00:00:27.369
needs to be submerged in acid at all times
so it doesn't kill everything in sight.

00:00:27.369 --> 00:00:32.040
So, we would like to advise Dr. Bright to
stop looking for a Wondertainment logo on

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:38.750
SCP-682's upper palate, as well as on its
posterior, stomach, or the bottom of its foot.

00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:41.840
That's a pretty good way to get yourself eaten
alive.

